      "content": "I'm sorry you feel this way, but remember that even when things feel overwhelming, your capacity to build a life that fits you rather than the machine is still right there. True peace often begins when you have the courage to set a very firm boundary on what you will or will not submit to, even if it feels risky right now. You deserve to wake up one day not just moving, but actually living for yourself again.",
      "source": "target",
